OL,3,GNEWSAManchester venue floated to host
OL,4,AG20 in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver the years it has played host to
OL,7,FThe Smiths, Oasis and X-Factor
OL,8,Fauditions, but now the former G-Mex
OL,9,Fcentre in Manchester is reportedly in
OL,10,Fthe running to host Donald Trump and
OL,11,Fother world leaders.
OL,13,FThe Manchester Central Convention
OL,14,FComplex has been floated to be the
OL,15,Fvenue for the G20, an annual gathering
OL,16,Fof the biggest economies from across
OL,17,Fthe globe, the Local Democracy
OL,18,FReporting Service said.
OL,20,FIf the city is chosen to host the
OL,21,Fevent, the G20 would be the largest
OL,22,Fsummit ever held in Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
